Boggle Game (Python)
A GUI-based implementation of the classic Boggle word game built with Python. Includes randomized boards, scoring, sound effects, and a dictionary-based word check.

Features-
4×4 randomized Boggle board

Word validation using a built-in dictionary

Interactive GUI with background and button sounds

Scoring system based on word length

Background music and effects (WAV/MP3)

How to Use-
Install Python 3.x

Run the game:

bash
Copy
Edit
python boggle.py
Type valid words you find on the board and submit to earn points

Key Files-
boggle.py: Main launcher for the game

model.py: Game logic and scoring

view.py: GUI using tkinter

boggle_board_randomizer.py: Generates 4×4 randomized board

boggle_dict.txt: Dictionary used for word validation

sounds/: Contains music and sound effects

menu_bg.png: Background image for the UI

Learning Goals-
GUI programming with tkinter

Handling audio and images in Python

Implementing game logic and validation

File I/O with word dictionaries

